#. module: printer_zpl2_stock
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:printer_zpl2_stock.field_stock_picking_type__lot_zpl2_label_id
msgid ""
"Default ZPL II label for lot/SN printing. Used when the product does not "
"define its own ZPL label template. When a custom ZPL label is selected, the "
"official IoT printing method is replaced by direct ZPL II printing to the "
"configured printer."
msgstr "批号/序列号打印的默认 ZPL II 标签。当产品未定义自身的 ZPL 标签模板时使用此标签。选择自定义 ZPL 标签后，官方的 IoT 打印方式将被替换为直接向配置的打印机发送 ZPL II 指令打印。"

#. module: printer_zpl2_stock
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:printer_zpl2_stock.field_stock_picking_type__package_zpl2_label_id
msgid ""
"Default ZPL II label for package printing. When a custom ZPL label is "
"selected, the official IoT printing method is replaced by direct ZPL II "
"printing to the configured printer."
msgstr "包装打印的默认 ZPL II 标签。选择自定义 ZPL 标签后，官方的 IoT 打印方式将被替换为直接向配置的打印机发送 ZPL II 指令打印。"

