#. module: printer_zpl2_stock
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:printer_zpl2_stock.field_stock_picking_type__done_mrp_lot_zpl2_label_id
msgid ""
"Custom ZPL II label for lot/SN printing when a manufacturing order is done. "
"Used when the product does not define its own ZPL label template. When a "
"custom ZPL label is selected, the official IoT printing method is replaced by "
"direct ZPL II printing to the configured printer."
msgstr "制造订单完成时批号/序列号打印的自定义 ZPL II 标签。当产品未定义自身的 ZPL 标签模板时使用此标签。选择自定义 ZPL 标签后，官方的 IoT 打印方式将被替换为直接向配置的打印机发送 ZPL II 指令打印。"

