"a custom ZPL label is selected, the official IoT printing method is replaced "
"by direct ZPL II printing to the configured printer."
msgstr "生成新批号/序列号时打印的自定义 ZPL II 标签。选择自定义 ZPL 标签后，官方的 IoT 打印方式将被替换为直接向配置的打印机发送 ZPL II 指令打印。"

